Cyber Analytics Repository (CAR)

https://car.mitre.org/


CAR is a collection of ready-made detection analytics built around ATT&CK. 
Each analytic describes how to detect an adversary's behavior. This is key 
because it allows you to identify the patterns you should look for as a 
defender. CAR also provides example queries for common industry tools such 
as Splunk, so you, as a defender, can translate ATT&CK TTPs into real detections. 



